  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup packed brown sugar",
    "1 large egg",
    "2 tablespoons orange juice",
    "1 teaspoon grated orange zest",
    "2.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "2 cups chopped cranberries",
    "0.5 cup chopped walnuts",
    "1.5 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "3 tablespoons orange juice",
    "0.5 teaspoon grated orange zest"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vCR1voUjqHdKlnL9jRPQgefA2kc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40180-cranberry-orange-cookies-DDMFS-Step-1-0350c2397b9d44f4902accf92250373f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40180/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the cookies: Cream butter, white sugar, and brown sugar in a mixing bowl until smooth. Beat in egg until well blended. Mix in orange juice and zest.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4waPZhj5PMFPJrtxLfbs46FOPRg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40180-cranberry-orange-cookies-DDMFS-Step-2-8afd59e49f0043e9b42c023ecd92e9d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40180/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together flour, baking soda, and salt in a separate bowl. Stir flour mixture into the butter mixture until combined. Mix in cranberries and walnuts until evenly distributed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G9GMq8CilUCxbgKFchBONq3PnF4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40180-cranberry-orange-cookies-DDMFS-Step-3-1070a61910d64d3496de7d772ca5ef9a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40180/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop dough by rounded tablespoonfuls 2 inches apart onto ungreased cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cViryIA6hXOtBnYYwlH5u47WYEM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40180-cranberry-orange-cookies-DDMFS-Step-4-a56b0243b9d94822836d39a137f4a3ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40180/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven, switching racks halfway through, until edges are golden, 12 to 14 minutes. Transfer cookies to wire racks to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/63bp8pL6hy1Hwt_vDl9FhUhEnWc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40180-cranberry-orange-cookies-DDMFS-Step-5-f2d696b9edde4377bc15b3eff322d7b1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40180/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make the glaze: Mix together confectioners' sugar, orange juice, and zest in a small bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Sscm9x2QqVkCZDg3EnmtA7yotig=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40180-cranberry-orange-cookies-DDMFS-Step-6-4e859ecbe0874ba5bb2198629a2f61be.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40180/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread glaze over the tops of the cooled cookies; let stand until set.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BfKwAM7zWIWJy5iEsGp5WJNVRyw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40180-cranberry-orange-cookies-DDMFS-4x3-9aae32b0e92446078429bac47f102439.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40180/step_07.webp"
    }
